# What `vercel deploy` leaves out of the upload.
#
# The Vercel CLI does not read .gitignore: everything not listed here is
# uploaded. That is deliberate, the same way .ebignore works, because it is how
# the gitignored course bank data/problems.json reaches the server.
#
# .elasticbeanstalk/ holds earlier application bundles (with the bank and a
# database inside them) and instance logs. .env holds the Supabase password.
.git
.elasticbeanstalk
.vercel
.venv
venv
__pycache__
*.pyc
.env
.env.*
results
tmp
*.zip
data/*.db
data/*.db-wal
data/*.db-shm
